{
  "Name": "Druva inSync inSyncCPHwnet64.exe RPC Type 5 Privilege Escalation",
  "Description": "Druva inSync client for Windows exposes a network service on TCP port 6064 on the local network interface. inSync versions 6.6.3 and prior do not properly validate user-supplied program paths in RPC type 5 messages, allowing execution of arbitrary commands as SYSTEM. This module has been tested successfully on inSync versions 6.5.2r99097 and 6.6.3r102156 on Windows 7 SP1 (x64).",
